	(text "Every input: 22 V flat-clamp TVS (solar and drone behind a reverse-blocking Schottky), then a\nTPS259470A eFuse. Cut-offs: USB 5.4 V / 1.5 A, drone 5.8 V / 1.3 A, solar 10 V / 1.3 A. All survive 20 V."
